      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `fetch_db_secret.py` that fetches a database connection secret at runtime, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. AWS Secrets Manager is a suitable choice for this task as it is a managed service for secrets management. The code will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS Secrets Manager, making the provider identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of AWS-specific client methods. </thinking>\n",
